      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized corrosion weakens the surface and creates positive feedback that accelerates both wear and corrosion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial alloy has an intact protective passive oxide film that provides moderate resistance under static-corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized corrosion pits act as stress concentrators.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical wear removes or thins the protective oxide film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11378927::web::022::synergistic_effect_between_ce_and_corros"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freshly exposed metal surfaces are more susceptible to corrosion than passivated surfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11378927::web::022::synergistic_effect_between_ce_and_corros",
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized corrosion increases surface roughness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Corrosion-induced surface roughness accelerates abrasive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simultaneous tribo-corrosion produces total degradation greater than the sum of independently measured wear-only and corrosion-only degradation.",
      "field": "mechanism; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11378927::web::022::synergistic_effect_between_ce_and_corros"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear-only exposure causes minimal damage because the passive film remains intact.",
